The [[Rope]] is an item obtained by combining two [[Twine]]. [[Twine]] is a common available in the shop for [[Adventurer]]s or players with [[Twine Badge]]. Twine crafts into lots of useful items, with [[Rope]] certainly not being the most enticing, but the [[Sewing Case]] and [[Twine Badge]] both open up the possibility of buying many of them at once. It can be difficult to craft good recipes with every single [[Twine]] the player has, and with enough of an excess, one can at least craft this [[Rope]]. 

The [[Rope]] causes the {{icon/diamond}} item to temporarily trigger faster for each time the {{icon/star}} item activates. One can therefore put a quickly triggering item at the {{icon/star}} position to garner a relatively high speed boost to the {{icon/diamond}} item, which can certainly be effective if the {{icon/diamond}} item is good enough.
